1
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,256
Two goals in three minutes…

2
00:00:07,906 --> 00:00:10,169
and Agia Sophia disappeared

3
00:00:09,969 --> 00:00:11,006
into smoke.

4
00:00:20,649 --> 00:00:22,182
For nineteen years,

5
00:00:21,982 --> 00:00:24,241
AEK had no home of its own.

6
00:00:24,361 --> 00:00:26,235
In September twenty

7
00:00:26,035 --> 00:00:29,144
twenty-two… it finally did.

8
00:00:29,265 --> 00:00:31,919
Agia Sophia, in Nea Filadelfeia.

9
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:34,150
Ten years earlier,

10
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:35,630
the club had gone down.

11
00:00:35,970 --> 00:00:36,490
Now,

12
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:37,830
in its first season back

13
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:40,890
home… it was chasing a title.

14
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:42,839
Wednesday,

15
00:00:42,639 --> 00:00:44,602
the twenty-sixth of April.

16
00:00:44,722 --> 00:00:46,095
PAOK at home.

17
00:00:46,215 --> 00:00:47,695
Four games left…

18
00:00:48,345 --> 00:00:50,594
and the title between AEK

19
00:00:50,394 --> 00:00:51,916
and Panathinaikos.

20
00:00:55,170 --> 00:00:56,270
Before kick-off,

21
00:00:56,410 --> 00:00:57,790
the floodlights went off…

22
00:00:58,050 --> 00:01:00,050
and the stands lit

23
00:00:59,850 --> 00:01:00,850
the pitch themselves.

24
00:01:15,969 --> 00:01:17,350
Inside ten minutes,

25
00:01:17,469 --> 00:01:18,909
PAOK were down to ten.

26
00:01:19,170 --> 00:01:20,590
Kargas, studs

27
00:01:20,390 --> 00:01:23,409
on Jonsson's ankle… Straight red.

28
00:01:24,530 --> 00:01:25,790
Twenty-one minutes.

29
00:01:26,049 --> 00:01:28,469
Kotarski plays it short to Schwab.

30
00:01:28,689 --> 00:01:30,270
Jonsson takes it off

31
00:01:30,070 --> 00:01:32,450
him… Steven Zuber.

32
00:01:39,530 --> 00:01:43,189
And Gate 21 answered… in flares.

33
00:01:45,329 --> 00:01:46,447
One–nil.

34
00:01:46,566 --> 00:01:48,004
The board says so.

35
00:01:49,930 --> 00:01:51,367
Three minutes later.

36
00:01:51,487 --> 00:01:53,501
A corner from Hajsafi.

37
00:01:53,621 --> 00:01:55,403
Jonsson heads it back

38
00:01:55,203 --> 00:01:57,977
across… Harold Moukoudi.

39
00:02:05,210 --> 00:02:06,270
Ten minutes later,

40
00:02:06,070 --> 00:02:08,069
the smoke was still hanging

41
00:02:07,870 --> 00:02:08,810
over the pitch.

42
00:02:09,929 --> 00:02:11,580
Two–nil at the break.

43
00:02:11,700 --> 00:02:14,033
And Gate 21 kept singing…

44
00:02:14,683 --> 00:02:16,312
through half-time too.

45
00:02:22,169 --> 00:02:23,189
Seventy-seven.

46
00:02:23,589 --> 00:02:25,769
Paolo Fernandes hits the bar…

47
00:02:25,569 --> 00:02:28,989
and seconds later, Levi García.

48
00:02:29,469 --> 00:02:30,289
Left foot,

49
00:02:30,089 --> 00:02:31,689
from the edge of the box.

50
00:02:40,359 --> 00:02:41,339
And Fernandes,

51
00:02:41,639 --> 00:02:42,499
who had been looking

52
00:02:42,299 --> 00:02:43,439
for one all night…

53
00:02:48,169 --> 00:02:49,049
Found one.

54
00:02:57,369 --> 00:02:59,309
Eighteen shots for AEK.

55
00:02:59,769 --> 00:03:01,169
One for PAOK.

56
00:03:05,369 --> 00:03:06,492
Ninety minutes

57
00:03:06,292 --> 00:03:09,128
on the board… four–nil.

58
00:03:14,369 --> 00:03:16,309
Level on points at the top.

59
00:03:16,109 --> 00:03:19,709
And on Sunday… Panathinaikos,

60
00:03:19,509 --> 00:03:20,289
away.

61
00:03:23,929 --> 00:03:25,665
A draw at Leoforos.

62
00:03:25,785 --> 00:03:27,798
A draw with Olympiacos.

63
00:03:27,918 --> 00:03:31,592
A win in Thessaloniki… and then,

64
00:03:31,392 --> 00:03:33,278
on the last night, Volos.

65
00:03:33,398 --> 00:03:34,515
Four–nil.

66
00:03:35,369 --> 00:03:36,069
Champions.

67
00:03:36,629 --> 00:03:39,649
The thirteenth title… the first

68
00:03:39,449 --> 00:03:40,829
in their new home.

69
00:03:41,929 --> 00:03:42,969
Ten days later,

70
00:03:43,089 --> 00:03:45,669
PAOK again in the cup final.

71
00:03:45,989 --> 00:03:46,429
Two–nil.

72
00:03:46,229 --> 00:03:48,289
The first double since

73
00:03:48,089 --> 00:03:49,589
nineteen seventy-eight.

74
00:03:50,969 --> 00:03:53,669
And then… the ride home.

75
00:03:54,769 --> 00:03:55,849
Were you there?

76
00:03:56,309 --> 00:03:57,249
If you were there,

77
00:03:57,429 --> 00:03:58,969
or wish you had been, subscribe.

78
00:03:59,589 --> 00:04:00,369
Next week,

79
00:04:00,549 --> 00:04:01,989
another night from the stand.
